<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sk">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cestovná kancelária</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        header {
            background: #0073e6;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .container {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .destination {
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: white;
            display: inline-block;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        img {
            width: 300px;
            height: 200px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>Cestovná kancelária - Objavte svet s nami</header>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="destination">
            <h2>Maldivy</h2>
            <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/300x200/?maldives,beach" alt="Maldivy">
            <p>Rajská dovolenka s bielym pieskom a tyrkysovým morom.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="destination">
            <h2>Paríž</h2>
            <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/300x200/?paris,eiffel" alt="Paríž">
            <p>Romantické mesto lásky s úžasnou atmosférou.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="destination">
            <h2>Dubai</h2>
            <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/300x200/?dubai,skyline" alt="Dubai">
            <p>Moderné mesto luxusu a architektonických divov.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

